7. Prints the resulting ciphertext in hexadecimal format

The key points are:

- AES_set_encrypt_key() to initialize the AES key 
- AES_cbc_encrypt() to perform the actual encryption 
- Specifying AES_ENCRYPT as the last argument for encryption

