Error messages are printed using the "fail" function, which takes a message and an optional exception.
```javascript
fail('Something went wrong');
```

TAPE also supports a number of other functions and utilities for working with test data, setting up mocks, and handling errors. The full list of TAPE functions can be found in the official documentation.

