console.log(firstNonSpace); // Output: 11
```
In this example, the function returns the index of the first non-space character that is surrounded by spaces (index 11). The string is "   This   string   has   spaces   around   its   non-space   characters". The first non-space character that is surrounded by spaces is "This", so the function returns its index (11).

