- An NSTextView for entering input 
- A button to trigger the JSON conversion
- A second NSTextView to display the output JSON
- In the action method, it converts the input string to JSON using the JSONSerialization API
- It handles any errors in the conversion
- It pretty-prints the JSON to make it human readable

