This template creates a new AWS Lambda function with the name "MyFunction" using the Python 3.8 runtime. It specifies the S3 bucket where the function code and dependencies are stored and the handler function that will be invoked when the function is executed. It also sets the memory size and timeout for the function and defines an environment variable.

2. Deploy the CloudFormation stack: Once you have created the CloudFormation template, you can deploy it to your AWS account by running the following command in the AWS CLI:
```css
