1. Install `nostr-tools` using npm:
```bash
npm install nostr-tools
```
2. Import the `relayInit`, `generatePrivateKey`, `getPublicKey`, `getEventHash`, and `signEvent` functions from `nostr-tools` in your Svelte component:
```svelte
<script>
  import {
    relayInit,
    generatePrivateKey,
    getPublicKey,
    getEventHash,
    signEvent
  } from 'nostr-tools';

  // Initialize the relay
  const relay = relayInit('wss://relay.example.com');

  // Generate a new private key
  const privateKey = generatePrivateKey();

  // Get the public key from the private key
  const publicKey = getPublicKey(privateKey);

  // Get the event hash
  const eventHash = getEventHash();

  // Sign the event hash with the private key
  const signedEventHash = signEvent(eventHash, privateKey);
</script>

<p>Relay URL: {relay.url}</p>
<p>Private Key: {privateKey}</p>
<p>Public Key: {publicKey}</p>
<p>Event Hash: {eventHash}</p>
<p>Signed Event Hash: {signedEventHash}</p>
```
